@startuml
!include ../_style.iuml
title Epic 1 — Profiles and notebooks

rectangle "Profiles and notebooks" {
  card US1_1 [
    **US-1.1  Pick a profile**
    As a //reader//, I want to pick or create a profile without signing in,
    so that my notebooks and memories are kept apart from other people's on this machine.
    ----
    * A profile has a label and can be renamed or deleted.
    * Deleting a profile removes its sessions, notebooks and memories.
    * There is no password: the app is a profile picker, not a login.
  ]
  card US1_2 [
    **US-1.2  Keep separate notebooks**
    As a //reader//, I want a notebook per topic,
    so that each conversation answers only from the sources I put in it.
    ----
    * A notebook is named automatically from its first question, and can be renamed.
    * Its sources, transcript, Studio items and settings belong to it alone.
  ]
  card US1_3 [
    **US-1.3  Read in Arabic or English**
    As an //Arabic-speaking reader//, I want the interface and the answers in Arabic,
    so that I can work with an Arabic corpus in its own language.
    ----
    * The UI switches to right-to-left with Arabic strings.
    * Prompts are served in the notebook's language (en / ar).
  ]
}
US1_1 -[hidden]down- US1_2
US1_2 -[hidden]down- US1_3
@enduml
